--| Eliminate a three-way disjunction in a deduction. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 13-Apr-2018.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 20-Apr-2024.)
theorem mpjao3dan (ph ps ch th ta: wff):
  $ wi (wa ph ps) ch $ >
  $ wi (wa ph th) ch $ >
  $ wi (wa ph ta) ch $ >
  $ wi ph (w3o ps th ta) $ >
  $ wi ph ch $;

